{{!--
  Pathfinder 2e — a run of labelled numbers on one line.

      {{> pairs for="front-saves"}}      →  ZÄH +14, REF +8, WIL +11

  The place holds a list of single-key maps, `- { ZÄH: 14 }`, the way the
  saves, skills and attributes are written: each item's one key is the
  bold label, its value the number, which gets its sign here. Items are
  separated by a comma; the caller supplies the label in front of the run.
--}}
{{#each (slot for list=true signed=true)}}{{#each this}}<span class="pf2e-pair-key">{{@key}}</span> {{this}}{{/each}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}